                      "type": "math",
                      "latex": "\\begin{aligned}2^{-t}&=\\frac15\\\\2^t&=5\\\\\\ln(2^t)&=\\ln(5)\\\\t\\ln(2)&=\\ln(5)\\\\\\therefore t&=\\frac{\\ln(5)}{\\ln(2)}\\end{aligned}",
